00:40:30.430 --> 00:40:33.640
bringing structured
data, bringing data

00:40:33.640 --> 00:40:37.990
across different modalities into
Google Cloud for health care

00:40:37.990 --> 00:40:42.490
data, as well as for
clinical entity extraction.

00:40:42.490 --> 00:40:44.950
We offer a framework
in which to do

00:40:44.950 --> 00:40:49.480
this, in which to do the data
ingestion with health care,

00:40:49.480 --> 00:40:54.430
understanding data
formats ingestion parts

00:40:54.430 --> 00:40:58.540
within our cloud health
care API, understanding HR7,

00:40:58.540 --> 00:41:01.570
understanding FHIR
understanding DICOM.

00:41:01.570 --> 00:41:06.220
We are building a framework
for cloud CDW where, again, you

00:41:06.220 --> 00:41:08.890
can use our data
harmonization tools.

00:41:08.890 --> 00:41:12.760
If you have data harmonization
tools that you already

00:41:12.760 --> 00:41:14.890
have built, you can use those.

00:41:14.890 --> 00:41:18.340
You can migrate
slowly over time.

00:41:18.340 --> 00:41:21.040
You can do what
you like with that

00:41:21.040 --> 00:41:25.600
in regards to your own tools or
other APIs that you've licensed

00:41:25.600 --> 00:41:27.820
versus using ours.

00:41:27.820 --> 00:41:30.610
And the same is true for
clinical entity extraction

00:41:30.610 --> 00:41:32.500
for natural language processing.

00:41:32.500 --> 00:41:34.480
You can bring your own model.

00:41:34.480 --> 00:41:38.170
You can use one of ours as we
develop them and release them.

00:41:38.170 --> 00:41:40.280
Or you can use a
